This toolkit is the open, Apache-2.0 reference layer extracted from the OMEGA
project. It is self-contained and does NOT include OMEGA's proprietary sector
engines, which remain under a separate licence and are not distributed here.

Dependency: `cryptography` (BSD/Apache-2.0), used for Ed25519 signatures.
Optional runtime tool: `openssl`, used for RFC 3161 timestamping.
